### Knowledge Saved for Future SDD Cycles

- **GFX dual-context pattern**: `main.lua` and `compact.lua` each have their own GFX context. `gfx.mouse_wheel` values are independent — each MUST read-and-zero separately.
- **Delta lifecycle**: GFX-level zeroing clears `gfx.mouse_wheel` per frame. Widget-level zeroing clears `config.state.mouse_wheel_delta` per widget. Both layers required.
- **Direction convention**: This codebase uses `mouse_wheel_delta > 0 → -1` for index-based navigation (pagination precedent). Any future scroll feature MUST follow this convention OR update ALL scroll consumers at once.
